  "method": "initialLiability = present value of the 36 payments in arrears at 0.06/12 per month (ASC 842-20-30-1); initialRouAsset = liability (no initial direct costs, prepayments or incentives, 842-20-30-5). Per period: interest = openingLiability × 0.005, principal = payment − interest, closingLiability = openingLiability − principal; the final period's principal is the remaining balance and its interest the payment less that balance. Operating lease: leaseCost = total payments / 36 (842-20-25-6); rouAmortization = leaseCost − interest (842-20-35-3). Figures rounded to cents each period.",
  "validator": "asc842.lease.rollForward",
